Codegen: class patterns were unparsed as nothing (`case C():` became `case :`), and nested
as/or patterns lost their required parentheses.
Regression test included; fuzz repro: repro/fix-codegen-match-class-pattern.py (ruff_parse_idempotency).

diff --git a/crates/ruff_python_codegen/src/generator.rs b/crates/ruff_python_codegen/src/generator.rs
